Thumbs.db

# === Secrets & Environment ===
# Ignore ALL .env files EXCEPT .env.example, which is kept as documentation.
# The previous list enumerated suffixes and therefore missed `.env.dev` and
# `.env.prod`, both of which were committed with live Neon passwords, GitHub
# OAuth client secrets and the token-encryption key. Match broadly instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

